40
00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:29.039
Today, the class does experiments. First, they make a prediction. Is the apple floating or sinking? It's floating! They watch ice melting in the sun and put water in the freezer: freezing water becomes ice. Malis puts coloured water in a test tube. They see evaporation and make shadows with a torch.

